lass=\"mw-valign-text-top noprint\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16711#identifiers\" title=\"위키데이터에서 편집하기\"><img alt=\"위키데이터에서 편집하기\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg/20px-OOjs_UI_icon_edit-ltr-progressive.svg.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a></span></div></th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">국제</th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\"><ul><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://viaf.org/viaf/246581867\">VIAF</a></span></li><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://d-nb.info/gnd/4152852-9\">GND</a></span></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">국가</th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-even\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\"><ul><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://id.loc.gov/authorities/sh87007725\">미국</a></span></li><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987007539268705171\">이스라엘</a></span></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:1%\">기타</th><td class=\"navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-odd\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0\"><div style=\"padding:0 0.25em\"><ul><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/sbdb.cgi?sstr=20000433\">JPL SBDB</a></span></li><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.minorplanetcenter.net/db_search/show_object?object_id=433\">MPC</a></span></li><li><span class=\"uid\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lux.collections.yale.edu/view/place/e98a5d85-4de5-428c-9fb3-46ec502be5f3\">예일 LUX</a></span></li></ul></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<table class=\"notice metadata plainlinks stub\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: smaller;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Asteroid_wh.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Asteroid_wh.jpg/60px-Asteroid_wh.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Asteroid_wh.jpg/120px-Asteroid_wh.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"293\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>이 글은 소행성에 관한 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%9C%84%ED%82%A4%EB%B0%B1%EA%B3%BC:%ED%86%A0%EB%A7%89%EA%B8%80\" title=\"위키백과:토막글\">토막글</a>입니다. 여러분의 지식으로 알차게 <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//ko.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=433_%EC%97%90%EB%A1%9C%EC%8A%A4&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=433_%EC%97%90%EB%A1%9C%EC%8A%A4&amp;action=edit\">문서를 완성해</a> 갑시다.\n</td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐9fb74df6f‐h6642\nCached time: 20261003101134\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: 모듈:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.324 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.460 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1466/1000000\nRevision size: 4835/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 31529/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1471/2097152 bytes\nHighest expa